" end="00:35.030">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.250" end="00:41.210"><span begin="00:37.250" end="00:37.670">When </span><span begin="00:37.670" end="00:37.820">we </span><span begin="00:37.820" end="00:38.210">both </span><span begin="00:38.210" end="00:38.510">fall </span><span begin="00:38.510" end="00:39.290">asleep</span><span begin="00:39.290" end="00:39.380">, </span><span begin="00:39.380" end="00:40.010">underneath </span><span begin="00:40.010" end="00:40.100">the </span><span begin="00:40.100" end="00:40.520">same </span><span begin="00:40.520" end="00:41.210">sky</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.360" end="00:44.210"><span begin="00:41.360" end="00:41.600">To </span><span begin="00:41.600" end="00:41.720">the </span><span begin="00:41.720" end="00:42.200">beats </span><span begin="00:42.200" end="00:42.410">of </span><span begin="00:42.410" end="00:42.530">our </span><span begin="00:42.530" end="00:43.040">hearts </span><span begin="00:43.040" end="00:43.130">at </span><span begin="00:43.130" end="00:43.250">the </span><span begin="00:43.250" end="00:43.730">same </span><span begin="00:43.730" end="00:44.210">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.330" end="00:47.930"><span begin="00:44.330" end="00:44.840">So </span><span begin="00:44.840" end="00:45.290">close </span><span begin="00:45.290" end="00:45.590">but </span><span begin="00:45.590" end="00:46.010">so </span><span begin="00:46.010" end="00:46.520">far </span><span begin="00:46.520" end="00:47.930">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.930" end="00:50.900"><span begin="00:47.930" end="00:47.960">（</span><span begin="00:47.960" end="00:48.500">Can </span><span begin="00:48.500" end="00:48.680">you </span><span begin="00:48.680" end="00:49.250">hear </span><span begin="00:49.250" end="00:50.120">me</span><span begin="00:50.120" end="00:50.510">?</span><span begin="00:50.510" end="00:50.900">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.900" end="00:53.960"><span be